"""
Chapter5_results_analysis.py

Standalone script for reproducing Chapter 5 results of the manuscript:
"A deep multimodal fusion model for real-time identification of mixed strata in shield tunnelling".

This script is designed to be run AFTER the main training script has generated:
    - final_model.pth
    - final_scaler.pkl  (optional; if absent, the scaler is refitted using the same chronological training split)
    - logs/best_model_fold_1.pth ... logs/best_model_fold_8.pth  (optional for Section 5.1 forward-chaining results)

It does NOT retrain the model and does NOT change any model weights. It only loads saved models,
reconstructs the chronological data splits, evaluates the models, and performs post-hoc ablation
and sensitivity analyses in the same order as Chapter 5.

Output directory:
    results/chapter5_results/

Expected folder/data layout options:
    1) Script in repository root:
       ./Chapter5_results_analysis.py
       ./tunnelling_parameter_1.xlsx
       ./11/ ./22/ ./33/
       ./final_model.pth
       ./final_scaler.pkl
       ./logs/best_model_fold_*.pth

    2) Script in code subfolder, data/images/model in parent folder:
       ./code/Chapter5_results_analysis.py
       ./tunnelling_parameter_1.xlsx
       ./11/ ./22/ ./33/
       ./code/final_model.pth
       ./code/final_scaler.pkl
       ./code/logs/best_model_fold_*.pth

Run:
    python Chapter5_results_analysis.py

Optional:
    python Chapter5_results_analysis.py --skip-kfold
    python Chapter5_results_analysis.py --results-dir results/chapter5_results
"""

